      "widgets_values": [
        "# H3 Scribe — Composer Quality Workflow\n\nDevelopment-only workflow for Q4/Q3 semantic comparison.\n\nFlow:\n`Authoring → Compose → Simple Qwen → Raw Qwen → Validate & Render → Final H3 Prompt`\n\n`quality/run.py` loads this exact workflow. It executes to **Raw Qwen** first so malformed JSON is preserved, then validates/renders that captured text without running Qwen again.\n\nYou can also open this JSON in ComfyUI and inspect/run it manually.\n\nThe runner replaces Model / mmproj / Authoring per test case."
      ],
      "title": "Composer quality — read me"
    },
